1. Compile error: Missing `override` on functions implementing IBEP20. Lines: 47, 51, 55, 59, 64, 68, 72, 80, 86, 90. Actually totalSupply at 59, decimals 47, symbol 51, name 55, getOwner 64, balanceOf 68, transfer 72, approve 80, allowance 86, transferFrom 90. All require `override`. This alone makes it non-deployable.

