7. `multiply` function is unused and has a strange pattern. Not a security issue but dead code. Lines 138-142.

8. `SafeMath` uses `assert` instead of `require`. In Solidity 0.8, arithmetic already reverts on overflow, so SafeMath is redundant. `assert` consumes all gas on failure. Lines 104, 110.

